{"study_accession":"PRJNA1313769","secondary_study_accession":"SRP615767","title":"Whole transcriptome sequencing of peripheral blood leukocytes in patients with myocardial infarction","description":"Myocardial Infarction (MI) is one of the leading causes of death and disability worldwide. Peripheral blood leukocytes, as core participants in immune and inflammatory responses, have significant changes in gene expression during the occurrence and development of myocardial infarction. This study aims to comprehensively depict the transcriptome landscape of peripheral blood leukocytes in patients with myocardial infarction through whole transcriptome sequencing (RNA-Seq) technology. A total of 5 patients with acute myocardial infarction were recruited in this study. Peripheral venous blood was collected upon admission, and white blood cells were isolated and extracted by gradient centrifugation. High-throughput sequencing was performed using the HiSeqX Ten platform, and a chain-specific transcriptome sequencing library was constructed.","pubmed":"","geo_series":"","n_samples":5,"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN50907727","study_accession":"PRJNA1313769","blood_class":"whole_blood","class_from":"sample","title":"Human sample from Homo sapiens","description":"Human sample from Homo sapiens","sex":"male","geo_sample":"","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2026-07-01","attributes":[["isolate","Xiyuan Hospital"],["age","not applicable"],["biomaterial_provider","Meiwen, Huang"],["collection_date","2020-06-02"],["geo_loc_name","China: beijing"],["sex","male"],["tissue","blood"],["isolation_source","blood 1"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR35235495","experiment_accession":"SRX30338719","library_layout":"PAIRED","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"HiSeq X Ten","read_count":43277677,"base_count":12983303100,"first_public":"2026-07-01","experiment_title":"HiSeq X Ten sequencing: sample_A1"}],"labels":[]},{"sample_accession":"SAMN50907728","study_acces